<title>CYPRUS: Key facts about S-300 missile system.</title>
<headline>Key facts about S-300 missile system.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the basic specifications of the S-300 surface-to-air missile system which Cyprus plans to buy from Russia, as reported by Jane's Land-Based Air Defence:</p>
<p>- Maximum effective interception range of aircraft-type targets at 150 km (90 miles). Minimum effective interception altitude 10 metres (yards).</p>
<p>- Engagement of ballistic-type targets successfully at ranges up to 40 km (25 miles).</p>
<p>- Maximum target velocity capability of 2,788 metres (yards) per second (10,000 km/h).</p>
<p>- Battery deployment time five minutes. One missile can be fired every three seconds.</p>
<p>- Maximum total of missiles available in the battery is 32 rounds.</p>
</text>
